寂しいからこの世界から出たかったんだ
I got lonely, so I wanted to leave this world.

416
00:29:11,536 --> 00:29:13,836
寂しかったからここを離れたかったの？
You wanted to leave because you were lonely?

417
00:29:13,936 --> 00:29:16,336
わ 私ね ジジとセシリアと戦うことになって
I, I ended up fighting Gigi and CC,

418
00:29:16,436 --> 00:29:19,036
何が起きてるのかさっぱり分からなかったのに
and I had no idea what was going on.

419
00:29:19,236 --> 00:29:22,836
まぁ 私のところには人が来なくて探検に来たんだ
Well, nobody came to my place, so I decided to go exploring.

420
00:29:23,036 --> 00:29:26,036
そうだ！私とも戦ってくれる？楽しそう！
Alright! Will you fight me too? It sounds fun!

421
00:29:26,236 --> 00:29:28,536
ちゃんと聞いてないよね...
You aren't really listening, are you...

422
00:29:28,836 --> 00:29:32,536
戦いだって楽しんだもん勝ちだよ！いくよ！
A battle is only fun if you enjoy it! Here I come!

423
00:29:32,636 --> 00:29:34,836
いったいどうしちゃったの？
What's wrong with you?

424
00:29:37,836 --> 00:29:40,036
私の武器はハンマー！
So my weapon is a hammer.

425
00:29:40,136 --> 00:29:41,836
いくよ！
Here I come!

426
00:29:42,236 --> 00:29:43,836
やぁー！
Hya!

427
00:29:45,036 --> 00:29:48,236
適当にあしらって終わらせようかな
Maybe I'll just humor her and get this over with.

428
00:29:52,036 --> 00:29:54,236
本気でやらないとおもしろくないよ！
It's no fun if you don't take it seriously!

429
00:29:54,536 --> 00:29:57,236
本気出したらやっつけちゃうでしょ！！
But if I do, I'll end up defeating you!!

430
00:29:57,536 --> 00:30:00,036
大丈夫 大丈夫！ほら来い！
It's fine, it's fine. Come on, hit me with it.

431
00:30:00,072 --> 00:30:01,072
It's fine, it's fine. Come on, hit me with it.

432
00:30:01,272 --> 00:30:03,372
Well, don't say I didn't warn you.

433
00:30:07,872 --> 00:30:09,572
Ohoooo!

434
00:30:13,872 --> 00:30:15,672
Yeah. See, I told you.

435
00:30:17,672 --> 00:30:18,972
That was awesome!

436
00:30:19,072 --> 00:30:19,772
Huh?

437
00:30:19,872 --> 00:30:21,072
That was amazing!

438
00:30:21,172 --> 00:30:24,172
Oh, you're the amazing one!

439
00:30:24,872 --> 00:30:25,872
Well, that was fun.

440
00:30:25,972 --> 00:30:27,772
So let's stop worrying about this world,

441
00:30:27,872 --> 00:30:29,072
sing, dance,

442
00:30:29,172 --> 00:30:31,672
and have a good time before we head home!

443
00:30:32,772 --> 00:30:35,572
I'm fine with the singing and dancing part,

444
00:30:35,672 --> 00:30:38,172
but isn't this a little sudden?

445
00:30:38,772 --> 00:30:41,572
And how exactly are you planning on getting us home?

446
00:30:41,772 --> 00:30:42,672
Well...

447
00:30:42,772 --> 00:30:44,272
I don't know!

448
00:30:47,872 --> 00:30:50,072
純情？何それ 愛情？何それ
Pure heart? What's that? Romance? What's that?

449
00:30:50,072 --> 00:30:52,572
美味しいの？ねぇ 美味しいの？ってば
Is it yummy? Hey, is it yummy, I said!

450
00:30:52,572 --> 00:30:57,872
乱暴ダメダメ 感情捨て去り いっせーので ぶっ飛ばすだけ
Violence is a big no-no, throw away feelings, on three, just blow it all away!

451
00:30:58,072 --> 00:31:03,172
混沌ブギウギ ハッピー特盛り ドンピシャイだ ドンピシャイだもん
Chaos boogie-woogie, extra large serving of happy! Right on target, because it's right on target!

452
00:31:03,172 --> 00:31:08,072
だんだん落ちてく IQくそわる いっせーので 死ぬまで踊れ
My IQ is dropping fast, it's so bad! On three, dance until you die!

453
00:31:18,072 --> 00:31:20,272
完全体の山田
Yamada in perfect form,

454
00:31:20,272 --> 00:31:22,972
無関心なんてありえない
it's impossible to be indifferent to it.

455
00:31:22,972 --> 00:31:27,572
3000体の桑田の方がいいかな
Maybe 3,000 Kuwatas would be better...

456
00:31:28,172 --> 00:31:30,872
わがままばかりじゃ落ち着かない
Being selfish all the time won't calm me down,

457
00:31:30,872 --> 00:31:33,272
冷や汗が出すぎて気持ち悪い
breaking out in a cold sweat makes me feel sick.

458
00:31:33,272 --> 00:31:35,872
当たり前のことも手につかない
I can't even focus on everyday things,

459
00:31:35,872 --> 00:31:38,272
もう何て言ったらいい？ばかりで
saying 'What should I even say?' over and over.

460
00:31:38,272 --> 00:31:40,872
世間体とか投げ出したい
I want to throw away social appearances,

461
00:31:40,872 --> 00:31:43,372
狂ったように泣き出したい
I want to burst into tears like crazy,

462
00:31:43,372 --> 00:31:47,772
思うがまま生きて消えていきたいな
I want to live as I please and just fade away.

463
00:31:48,372 --> 00:31:50,172
純情？何それ 愛情？何それ
Pure heart? What's that? Romance? What's that?

464
00:31:50,172 --> 00:31:53,372
美味しいの？ねぇ 美味しいの？ってば
Is it yummy? Hey, is it yummy, I said!

465
00:31:53,372 --> 00:31:58,372
乱暴ダメダメ 感情捨て去り いっせーので ぶっ飛ばすだけ
Violence is a big no-no, throw away feelings, on three, just blow it all away!

466
00:31:58,872 --> 00:32:04,072
混沌ブギウギ ハッピー特盛り ドンピシャイだ ドンピシャイだもん
Chaos boogie-woogie, extra large serving of happy! Right on target, because it's right on target!

467
00:32:04,072 --> 00:32:08,872
だんだん落ちてく IQくそわる いっせーので 死ぬまで踊れ
My IQ is dropping fast, it's so bad! On three, dance until you die!

468
00:32:18,872 --> 00:32:23,672
ワンツー 禍々 三四 刈り取り もういいんだって もういいんだって もう
One, two, calamity! Three, four, harvest! It's enough already, it's enough already, enough!

469
00:32:23,672 --> 00:32:27,772
ハッピーおかわり ギブミーときめき いっせーので さあ飛び込め
Second helping of happy, give me excitement! On three, come on, jump right in!

470
00:32:27,772 --> 00:32:32,372
本能ブギウギ 混沌特盛り もういいんだって もういいんだって もう
Instinct boogie-woogie, extra serving of chaos! It's enough already, it's enough already, enough!

471
00:32:32,372 --> 00:32:38,372
最低ヤツらの ライカミステリー いっせーので ぶっ飛ばすだけ
Like a mystery of the worst scum! On three, just blow it all away!

472
00:32:38,372 --> 00:32:44,272
混沌ブギウギ ハッピー特盛り ドンピシャイだ ドンピシャイだもん
Chaos boogie-woogie, extra large serving of happy! Right on target, because it's right on target!

473
00:32:44,272 --> 00:32:49,072
だんだん落ちてく 人生くそわる いっせーので 死ぬまで踊れ
My life quality is dropping fast, it's so bad! On three, dance until you die!

474
00:32:49,072 --> 00:32:53,872
もういいや 全部全部ほら 忘れてしまおう
Forget it all, look, let's just forget everything!

475
00:32:53,872 --> 00:33:00,672
簡単なことじゃないが 我々ならできるだろう
It's not an easy thing, but we can do it, right?

476
00:33:00,672 --> 00:33:03,572
なぁ？ Get down
Right? Get down!

477
00:33:54,672 --> 00:33:57,872
頭でわかっては嘆いた
I understood in my head and lamented,

478
00:33:57,872 --> 00:34:00,872
転がっていく様子を嗤った
sneered at the way things tumbled down.

479
00:34:00,872 --> 00:34:04,072
寂しいとか愛とかわかんない
I don't understand loneliness or love,

480
00:34:04,072 --> 00:34:07,472
人間の形は投げ出したんだ
I've abandoned my human form.

481
00:34:07,472 --> 00:34:13,272
抱えきれない 言葉だらけの存在証明を
An overwhelming proof of existence filled with words...

482
00:34:13,372 --> 00:34:16,472
この小さな劇場から出られらんない
I can't escape from this small theater,

483
00:34:16,472 --> 00:34:19,472
気づいたら最後逃げ出したい
once I realize it, I just want to run away.

484
00:34:19,472 --> 00:34:22,472
僕ら全員演じていたんだ
Every single one of us was acting,

485
00:34:22,472 --> 00:34:25,572
エンドロールに向かってゆくんだ
heading straight towards the end credits.

486
00:34:25,572 --> 00:34:30,072
さあ皆必死に役を演じて 傍観者なんていないのさ
Come on, everyone desperately play your role, there are no bystanders here.

487
00:34:30,072 --> 00:34:31,972
“ワタシ”なんてないの
There is no 'Me',

488
00:34:31,972 --> 00:34:33,872
どこにだって居ないよ
I'm nowhere to be found.

489
00:34:33,872 --> 00:34:38,272
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
All along, I've been unable to become anyone...

490
00:34:38,272 --> 00:34:40,872
僕ら今 さあさあ 喰らいあって
Now then, come on, let's devour each other,

491
00:34:40,872 --> 00:34:43,672
延長戦 サレンダーして メーデー
surrender in overtime, Mayday!

492
00:34:43,672 --> 00:34:46,472
淡い愛想 垂れ流し 言の愛憎
Spilling faint compliments, love and hate in words.

493
00:34:46,472 --> 00:34:51,872
ドラマチックな展開を どっか期待してんだろ
Deep down, you're expecting a dramatic plot twist, aren't you?

494
00:34:51,872 --> 00:34:54,472
君も YES YES 息を呑んで
You too, YES YES, hold your breath,

495
00:34:54,472 --> 00:34:56,872
采配は そこにあんだ ヘッドショット
the direction is right there, headshot!

496
00:34:56,872 --> 00:34:59,672
騒ぐ想いも その心撃ち抜いて
Shoot through your restless thoughts and that heart of yours.

497
00:34:59,672 --> 00:35:01,572
さあ まだ見ぬ糸を引いて
Come on, pull the unseen strings,

498
00:35:01,572 --> 00:35:03,072
黒幕のお出ましさ
it's time for the mastermind to make an entrance.

499
00:35:03,072 --> 00:35:05,060
その目に映るのは
What is reflected in those eyes...

500
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:07,860
触れたら壊れてしまった
Touched and it broke completely,

501
00:35:07,860 --> 00:35:09,160
間違っていく様子を黙った
I kept silent as things went wrong.

502
00:35:09,160 --> 00:35:10,860
僕ら全員無垢でありました
We were all innocent back then,

503
00:35:10,860 --> 00:35:12,560
いつのまにやら怪物になったんだ
but before we knew it, we became monsters.

504
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:18,260
その全てを肯定しないと前に進めないかい
Must we accept all of it to move forward?

505
00:35:19,060 --> 00:35:20,860
『まあ君にはきっと無理なんだ』
"Well, it's probably impossible for you."

506
00:35:20,860 --> 00:35:22,360
「だから君にはきっと無理なんだ」
"That's why it's surely impossible for you."

507
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,860
いつのまにやら外野にいたんだ
Before I knew it, I was on the sidelines,

508
00:35:23,860 --> 00:35:25,760
そんなガヤばっかり飛ばしてきたんだ
spewing nothing but useless noise.

509
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:31,560
皆必死に自分を守って 救いの手を待ってるのさ
Everyone desperately protects themselves, waiting for a helping hand.

510
00:35:31,560 --> 00:35:35,260
考えたくはないよ 馬鹿になっていたんだもん
I don't wanna think about it, I just wanted to stay foolish.

511
00:35:35,260 --> 00:35:40,560
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
All along, unable to become anyone...

512
00:35:40,560 --> 00:35:42,360
だから今 前線上
So now, on the front lines,

513
00:35:42,360 --> 00:35:44,860
その旗は高く舞って
that flag flies high.

514
00:35:44,860 --> 00:35:48,860
劣勢 頼る相棒 言葉すら必要ないよ
At a disadvantage, a trusted partner, no words needed.

515
00:35:48,860 --> 00:35:53,860
ドラマチックな展開はドットヒットしていくだろう
The dramatic turn of events will surely build up.

516
00:35:53,860 --> 00:35:57,860
君も YES YES 息を呑んで 再会を誓いあって
You too, yes yes, holding your breath, promising to meet again.

517
00:35:57,860 --> 00:36:01,560
ワンチャンスしかない僕の一瞬を賭けるのさ
Betting my one brief moment with only one chance.

518
00:36:01,560 --> 00:36:07,560
クライマックスみたいな 手に汗を握るのさ
A gripping, climax-like feeling.

519
00:36:07,560 --> 00:36:10,160
ぽつりと呟いた
Muttered quietly,

520
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:13,860
隠してきた真実はどこにもない
the truth I've hidden is nowhere to be found.

521
00:36:13,860 --> 00:36:17,060
嗤ってきた奴らに居場所はない
There's no place for those who sneered.

522
00:36:17,060 --> 00:36:20,360
思い出してぽいってして感情はない
Remembering then tossing it aside, no emotions left.

523
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:23,360
流した涙 理由なんてない
No reason for the tears shed.

524
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:26,360
優しさに温度も感じられない
Can't even feel the warmth in kindness.

525
00:36:26,360 --> 00:36:29,760
差し伸べた手に疑いしかない
Only doubt towards extended hands.

526
00:36:29,760 --> 00:36:33,060
穴が空いて愛は垂れてしまいになったんだ
A hole opened up, and love leaked out completely.

527
00:36:33,060 --> 00:36:36,060
倒れそうな僕を覗き込んだんだ
Looking down at me as I was about to collapse.

528
00:36:36,060 --> 00:36:42,760
諦めかけた人の前にアンタはいつも嗤うようにおでましさ
Before those about to give up, you always appear with a sneer.

529
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:45,860
君にはどんな風に見えてるんだい
How does it look to you?

530
00:36:45,860 --> 00:36:48,860
呼吸を整えてさ
Catching my breath...

531
00:36:48,860 --> 00:36:49,860
さあ
Now,

532
00:36:49,860 --> 00:36:55,060
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
all along, unable to become anyone...

533
00:36:55,060 --> 00:37:02,860
僕ら今さあさあ 喰らいあって 延長戦 サレンダーして メーデー 淡い愛想 垂れ流し 言の愛憎
Now we devour each other, extra time, surrendering, Mayday, spilling faint affection and hatred of words.

534
00:37:02,860 --> 00:37:07,860
ドラマチックな展開をどっか期待してんだろ
Expecting a dramatic development somewhere.

535
00:37:07,860 --> 00:37:12,060
君も YES YES 息を呑んで 采配はそこにあんだ
You too, yes yes, holding your breath, control is right there.

536
00:37:12,060 --> 00:37:15,860
ヘッドショット 騒ぐ想いも その心撃ち抜いて さあ
Headshot, shooting through those raging feelings and that heart, come on.

537
00:37:15,860 --> 00:37:21,860
まだ見ぬ糸を引いて 黒幕のお出ましさ
Pulling unseen strings, the mastermind appears.

538
00:37:21,860 --> 00:37:25,560
その目に映るのは
Reflected in those eyes is...

539
00:37:31,560 --> 00:37:35,060
セレナーデ
[Title: Serenade]

540
00:37:37,560 --> 00:37:44,860
都合のいい思いを燃やして 呆れた願いはもう手放した
Burning convenient memories, I've let go of my absurd wishes.

541
00:37:44,860 --> 00:37:51,560
裏切りや秘密が漂って ここから動けない
Betrayals and secrets drift about, I can't move from here.

542
00:37:51,560 --> 00:37:58,060
生まれてしまった あるいは壊れてしまった あの日のあの場所でずっと 止まったままでいた未来
Born into this, or perhaps broken, at that time and place, a future stopped in its tracks.

543
00:37:58,060 --> 00:38:05,260
それでも 心のどこかで君を感じていた 許せない 今の僕は誰？
Even so, somewhere in my heart I felt you, unable to forgive, who am I now?

544
00:38:05,260 --> 00:38:09,560
ねぇ ずっとずっとそばにいたんだ 「勘違いだ」って 嘘じゃないよ
Hey, I was by your side all along, "a misunderstanding", it's not a lie.

545
00:38:09,560 --> 00:38:17,860
望んだものじゃなくとも あなたに出会えた痛みだけが 愛だって信じられるように
Even if it wasn't what I wished for, so that I can believe the pain of meeting you is love.

546
00:38:17,860 --> 00:38:25,560
僕に触れないで！ 祈る セレナーデ 僕なしで上手く幸せになってね
Don't touch me! Praying serenade, please be happy without me.

547
00:38:25,560 --> 00:38:34,860
誰よりもずっと 何を手放しても これが愛だって信じていた 罰をください
More than anyone, whatever I let go of, I believed this was love, please punish me.

548
00:38:34,860 --> 00:38:42,060
誰でもない あなた あなただけ 世界がまだ忘れてくれなくても
No one else, only you, even if the world hasn't forgotten yet.

549
00:38:42,060 --> 00:38:51,260
きっと まだ あなた あなただけ 願い疲れても歌うよ セレナーデ
Surely, still only you, even if tired of wishing, I'll sing a serenade.

550
00:38:51,260 --> 00:38:56,560
願い疲れても歌うよ セレナーデ
Even if tired of wishing, I'll sing a serenade.

551
00:38:56,560 --> 00:39:04,860
シナリオ通りのコメディ 不幸自慢はハーモニー？ エゴイスティックに光った瞳の中に映っている「あなた」は「誰？」
A comedy according to scenario, bragging about misfortune in harmony? In those egoistically shining eyes, who is the "you" reflected?

552
00:39:04,860 --> 00:39:10,560
暗闇が光らせた舞台の上で 何も知らずにただ踊っていられたならよかった
On a stage illuminated by darkness, if only I could dance knowing nothing.

553
00:39:10,560 --> 00:39:15,060
希望も不幸も身勝手だ 僕らは 全員共犯者だった
Hope and misfortune are selfish, we were all accomplices.

554
00:39:15,060 --> 00:39:22,560
疑う余地もないほど 運命が定まった あの夜から 僕らは愛し方を忘れた
Leaving no room for doubt, fate was set, from that night, we forgot how to love.

555
00:39:22,560 --> 00:39:27,860
これだけ願って これだけ祈って こんな 悲しい結末でごめんね
Wishing this much, praying this much, I'm sorry for such a sad ending.

556
00:39:27,860 --> 00:39:34,860
すべて失って すべて消え去っても ただ 君がずっと生きていた 痛みが欲しい
Even if losing everything and everything fades away, I just want the pain of you living on.

557
00:39:34,860 --> 00:39:53,060
あと何回数えたら あと何回傷つけば あと何回失えば あと何回壊れたら
How many more times counting, how many more times hurt, how many more times losing, how many more times broken...

558
00:39:53,060 --> 00:39:59,060
あと何回数えたら あと何回傷つけば
How many more times counting, how many more times hurt...

559
00:40:00,096 --> 00:40:01,496
あと何回数えたら
How many more times must I count?

560
00:40:01,496 --> 00:40:02,896
あと何回傷つけば
How many more times must I be hurt?

561
00:40:02,896 --> 00:40:04,296
あと何回許せば
How many more times must I forgive?

562
00:40:04,296 --> 00:40:06,096
あと何回失えば
How many more times must I lose?

563
00:40:06,096 --> 00:40:08,596
この想いは満たされる？
Before these feelings are fulfilled?

564
00:40:08,596 --> 00:40:10,096
これだけ願って
Wishing this much,

565
00:40:10,096 --> 00:40:11,396
これだけ祈って
praying this much,

566
00:40:11,396 --> 00:40:15,096
こんな悲しい結末でごめんなさい
I'm sorry for such a sad conclusion.

567
00:40:15,096 --> 00:40:16,596
全て失って
Even if I lose everything,

568
00:40:16,596 --> 00:40:18,496
全て違っても
even if everything changes,

569
00:40:18,496 --> 00:40:23,096
ただ僕がずっと愛していた君よ
to you, whom I have always loved:

570
00:40:23,096 --> 00:40:26,096
消えないで 祈るセレナーデ
Please don't fade away... A serenade of prayer.

571
00:40:26,096 --> 00:40:29,096
泣かないで 幸せになってね
Please don't cry... Be happy, okay?

572
00:40:29,096 --> 00:40:31,296
誰よりもずっと
More than anyone else, forever...

573
00:40:31,296 --> 00:40:33,796
何を手放しても
No matter what I let go of,

574
00:40:33,796 --> 00:40:37,396
これが愛だって信じてた
I believed that this was love.

575
00:40:37,396 --> 00:40:38,896
罰をくだせ
Hand down my punishment.

576
00:40:38,896 --> 00:40:41,896
誰もいない あなた あなただけ
There's no one else... You, only you.

577
00:40:41,896 --> 00:40:45,096
世界がまだ 忘れてくれなくても
Even if the world still hasn't forgotten...

578
00:40:45,096 --> 00:40:48,896
きっとまだ あなた あなただけ
Surely still, you, only you,

579
00:40:48,896 --> 00:40:54,096
願い疲れても 歌うよ セレナーデ
even if tired of wishing, I will sing a serenade.

580
00:40:55,296 --> 00:40:57,596
雨が降り注いでも
Even if the rain pours down,

581
00:40:57,596 --> 00:40:59,096
僕じゃなくても
even if it isn't me,

582
00:40:59,096 --> 00:41:04,096
願い疲れても 歌うよ セレナーデ
even if tired of wishing, I will sing a serenade.

583
00:41:13,296 --> 00:41:14,396
クロニー！
Kronii!

584
00:41:14,796 --> 00:41:17,396
助けに来たよ！
I've come to save you!

585
00:41:20,596 --> 00:41:23,596
やっぱりスバル先輩！
I knew it, Subaru-senpai!

586
00:41:23,796 --> 00:41:25,896
どうして助けが必要ってわかったんですか？
How'd'ya know I needed help?

587
00:41:26,396 --> 00:41:30,496
ずっと見てたからね！
I've been watching the whole time!

588
00:41:30,896 --> 00:41:32,696
ずっと見てたんですか...？
The whole time...?

589
00:41:32,796 --> 00:41:33,896
私も？
And me?

590
00:41:34,096 --> 00:41:35,396
見てたよ
I watch you.

591
00:41:35,696 --> 00:41:37,396
あぁ そうですか
Oh, okay.

592
00:41:37,396 --> 00:41:39,196
それは怖いですけど
That's scary, but

593
00:41:39,196 --> 00:41:40,296
なんで？！
The Why?!

594
00:41:40,296 --> 00:41:43,196
だったらもっと早く助けてほしかったです！
I, I wish you helped me a lot sooner then!

595
00:41:43,696 --> 00:41:48,096
途中から楽しそうにしてたから
Well, you started having fun halfway through,

596
00:41:50,096 --> 00:41:56,896
どうなるか見守ろうかなと思って！
so I figured I'd see how things played out!

597
00:41:57,496 --> 00:41:58,596
うん
Yeah

598
00:41:58,596 --> 00:42:00,396
見てた...
I watched...

599
00:42:00,396 --> 00:42:01,396
ただ
just the

600
00:42:01,396 --> 00:42:02,696
世界を
world.

601
00:42:02,796 --> 00:42:03,996
オッケー うん
Okay. Yeah.

602
00:42:03,996 --> 00:42:06,096
あぁ 世界ね わかりました！
Oh, yeah. The world. Yeah.

603
00:42:06,096 --> 00:42:09,696
まあ確かに楽しかった部分もあったかも
Yeah. I mean, I guess I did end up enjoying parts of it.

604
00:42:09,696 --> 00:42:11,096
でしょ？！
See?!

605
00:42:11,096 --> 00:42:16,896
だから 本当に助けが必要なのかなって思ってたんだよ！
That's why I was wondering whether you actually needed saving!

606
00:42:17,596 --> 00:42:20,396
あぁ 一応ありがとうございます
Aw... well thank you, I guess,

607
00:42:20,396 --> 00:42:24,796
でも本当に ここから出るのを手伝ってくれるんですか？
but can you really help me get out of here?

608
00:42:25,696 --> 00:42:26,596
あと...
Just...

609
00:42:28,496 --> 00:42:29,896
待って
Please wait.

610
00:42:30,396 --> 00:42:31,796
どこ見てるんですか？
where are you looking?

611
00:42:31,796 --> 00:42:33,296
あと1曲だけ
Just one more song.

612
00:42:33,296 --> 00:42:36,796
心を込めて歌って踊れば
If you sing and dance your heart out,

613
00:42:36,796 --> 00:42:39,096
家に帰れるよ！
you can go home!

614
00:42:39,796 --> 00:42:41,896
本当に？ やった！
Really? Yay!

615
00:42:42,196 --> 00:42:44,796
世界を見てみて！
Just watch the world!

616
00:42:45,096 --> 00:42:46,396
世界！
The world!

617
00:42:46,396 --> 00:42:49,196
あぁ あれが世界なんだ
Oh, so that's the world.

618
00:42:51,196 --> 00:42:54,696
オッケー 待ってごめん 見入っちゃってた
Oh, okay. Wait. Sorry. I was so fascinated.

619
00:42:54,696 --> 00:42:55,796
スタッフさん
Please staff

620
00:42:55,796 --> 00:42:58,396
下上下上下上下上
Down up up up up up up.

621
00:42:58,396 --> 00:43:00,096
そうそう！
Yeah, yeah!

622
00:43:00,096 --> 00:43:02,696
本当に？！
Really?!

623
00:43:03,396 --> 00:43:10,096
カエラも戦って歌ったあとに消えたでしょう？
Kaela disappeared after fighting and singing, right?

624
00:43:10,496 --> 00:43:15,896
あれは元の世界に帰ったからなんだよ！
That's because she went back to the original world.

625
00:43:16,496 --> 00:43:18,896
戦って歌ったあとに？
After fighting and singing?

626
00:43:18,896 --> 00:43:22,096
待って それって私も戦わなきゃいけないってことですか？
Wait, does that mean I have to fight too?

627
00:43:22,196 --> 00:43:23,596
うん！
Yep!

628
00:43:23,796 --> 00:43:25,096
そう...
Oh...

629
00:43:29,896 --> 00:43:31,596
わけわかんない！
I don't get it!

630
00:43:31,596 --> 00:43:34,096
なんでそもそも戦わなきゃいけないの？！
Why do we have to fight at all?!

631
00:43:34,096 --> 00:43:38,796
何かの儀式みたいなものだと思って！
Think of it like some kind of ritual!

632
00:43:39,796 --> 00:43:43,796
オッケー じゃあそこに立って攻撃を受けるだけね
Okay, then we just stand there and take the hit,

633
00:43:43,796 --> 00:43:46,096
それで現実世界に戻ったら
and when we get back to the real world,

634
00:43:46,096 --> 00:43:50,096
ご飯を作って 私のこと甘やかしてもらうから！！！
you're going to make me food and spoil me!!!

635
00:43:57,696 --> 00:44:00,796
やめろ！ お願いやめて！ やめて！
Stop! Please stop please stop please.

636
00:44:00,796 --> 00:44:02,096
ちょっと！
YOU!

637
00:44:02,096 --> 00:44:03,796
正気か？！
Are you okay?!

638
00:44:05,796 --> 00:44:07,496
正気なの？！
Are you okay?!

639
00:44:07,496 --> 00:44:09,596
ちょっと待って なんでスバルがご飯作るの？！
Wait, why should I cook for you?!

640
00:44:09,596 --> 00:44:16,896
それに さっきもう甘やかしてもらってたでしょ！
And besides, you were already getting spoiled earlier!

641
00:44:18,496 --> 00:44:19,896
とにかく！
Anyway!

642
00:44:19,896 --> 00:44:21,896
楽しむのが大事！
You should have fun!

643
00:44:21,896 --> 00:44:24,796
喜びこそが鍵なんだよ！！
Joy is the key!!

644
00:44:25,096 --> 00:44:27,196
ほんとかなあ？
You sure about that?

645
00:44:27,196 --> 00:44:30,496
じゃあ楽しませてください
Then you have to entertain me.

646
00:44:30,496 --> 00:44:32,096
にゃ〜！
Meow!

647
00:44:33,496 --> 00:44:34,996
にゃ〜？
Meow?

648
00:44:35,496 --> 00:44:37,396
大丈夫...？
Are you okay...?

649
00:44:40,496 --> 00:44:41,896
とにかく！
Anyway!

650
00:44:41,896 --> 00:44:45,396
スバ友召喚！
I summon Subatomo!

651
00:44:48,396 --> 00:44:50,896
スバ友マジで可愛い！
Subatomo is soooo cute!

652
00:44:50,896 --> 00:44:54,696
マジで可愛いでしょ？ ね？
This is "super cute" right?

653
00:44:54,696 --> 00:44:56,596
うん でも
Yeah, but

654
00:44:56,596 --> 00:44:57,996
すごくちっちゃい
so tiny.

655
00:44:57,996 --> 00:44:59,096
ちっちゃい？
Tiny?

656
00:44:59,096 --> 00:45:00,196
すごく小さい
It's so small.

657
00:45:00,196 --> 00:45:01,096
うん！
Yeah!

658
00:45:01,096 --> 00:45:03,296
小さいのが可愛い！
Small is cute!

659
00:45:03,296 --> 00:45:04,508
見るだけで幸せになるでしょ？
Just looking at it makes you happy, right?

660
00:45:05,084 --> 00:45:08,084
Just looking at it makes you happy, right?

661
00:45:08,284 --> 00:45:09,484
Yeah. I mean, it's...

662
00:45:09,484 --> 00:45:11,684
...very adorable, but,

663
00:45:11,684 --> 00:45:12,784
...I'm...

664
00:45:12,784 --> 00:45:15,584
...I'm also right here too.

665
00:45:15,584 --> 00:45:16,884
Meow~

666
00:45:17,084 --> 00:45:18,584
meow meow~

667
00:45:18,684 --> 00:45:20,884
クロニーもマジで可愛い！
Kronii is super cute, too!

668
00:45:21,084 --> 00:45:24,584
でも　でも
But, but this is...

669
00:45:25,084 --> 00:45:26,884
これなに？
What is this?

670
00:45:27,084 --> 00:45:28,584
シャイクロニー？
Shy Kronii?

671
00:45:29,084 --> 00:45:29,884
No!

672
00:45:29,884 --> 00:45:32,284
違います～　やめてくださいよ～！
No, stoppppppp!

673
00:45:32,884 --> 00:45:35,584
クロニーは　にゃーなの？
Is Kronii a cat?

674
00:45:36,884 --> 00:45:38,084
私　私は...それでいいです
I-I-it's fine.

675
00:45:38,084 --> 00:45:40,584
わからないなら　もういいです
If you don't know, then, never mind.

676
00:45:40,884 --> 00:45:42,884
うん　もうなんでもいいや
It's... it's whatever

677
00:45:43,284 --> 00:45:45,884
ちょっと　怖すぎるよクロニー！
That's... way too creepy, Kronii!

678
00:45:46,084 --> 00:45:47,584
ねぇ！なんで?!
HEY, what's that mean?!

679
00:45:47,884 --> 00:45:51,884
今日のクロニーはちょっと　ちょっと大丈夫かな？
Today Kronii is a little, little are you okay?

680
00:45:52,084 --> 00:45:53,284
大丈夫？
Are you okay?

681
00:45:53,584 --> 00:45:56,584
私は大丈夫じゃないけど　そんなこと言わないで！
Hey, that's.. I'm never okay, But you shouldn't say that!

682
00:45:56,884 --> 00:46:00,084
というか　戦うんですよね？
Anyway, aren't we supposed to fight though?

683
00:46:00,084 --> 00:46:02,084
うん　よし！
Yeah. All right!

684
00:46:02,884 --> 00:46:04,584
スバ友大丈夫？
Subatomo, are you okay?

685
00:46:05,084 --> 00:46:07,084
いけ！スバ友！
Go Subatomo!

686
00:46:08,084 --> 00:46:10,084
よし　攻撃！行け　行け　行け　行け！
Yeah! Attack! Go go go go!

687
00:46:10,084 --> 00:46:11,884
攻撃！攻撃！
Attack! Attack!

688
00:46:14,584 --> 00:46:17,084
おまえー！！
You!!

689
00:46:18,084 --> 00:46:19,084
来い！
Come!

690
00:46:19,084 --> 00:46:20,084
戻れ　戻れ　戻れ　戻れ！！
Back back back back!!

691
00:46:20,084 --> 00:46:21,584
大丈夫？
Are you okay?

692
00:46:21,884 --> 00:46:22,884
なんか...
Subatomo...

693
00:46:23,084 --> 00:46:24,884
ちょっと弱いかもー
might be a little underwhelming...

694
00:46:25,084 --> 00:46:26,884
ウィークかもこいつ
This lil guy's a weakling

695
00:46:27,084 --> 00:46:30,084
さぁ　そろそろ準備しようかな
Well, I guess I should start getting prepared.

696
00:46:30,584 --> 00:46:31,884
全然痛くない
It doesn't even hurt.

697
00:46:32,084 --> 00:46:34,584
くすぐったくもない　ごめんね～
Not even tickle. Sorry.

698
00:46:36,584 --> 00:46:39,084
やばいぞ！やばい！
This is bad! Really bad!

699
00:46:40,584 --> 00:46:43,084
スバ友！
Subatomo!!

700
00:46:43,884 --> 00:46:46,884
一緒に受けよう！
We're taking this one together!

701
00:46:47,084 --> 00:46:49,284
やばい！やばい！
Oh no! Oh no!

702
00:46:49,584 --> 00:46:52,584
もう身代わりだよお前が！
We're taking this one together!

703
00:46:53,084 --> 00:46:56,284
助けて　お願いだよ　お願い！
Please, mercy! Please, mercy! Please!

704
00:46:56,584 --> 00:46:58,084
いくよー
Here I go...

705
00:46:58,884 --> 00:47:04,584
わあああ！
Waaah!

706
00:47:05,584 --> 00:47:07,884
そんなのなってないよ...
That's terrible...

707
00:47:08,284 --> 00:47:10,584
イェー！
Yayyy.

708
00:47:10,884 --> 00:47:12,584
ごめんね　でも　イェー！！
I'm sorry, but yayyyyy.

709
00:47:12,884 --> 00:47:15,584
スバ友ーーー！
Subatomo----!

710
00:47:15,884 --> 00:47:18,584
大丈夫かスバ友！
Are you okay, Subatomo!

711
00:47:19,584 --> 00:47:21,584
おお　生きてる　よかった
Oh it's alive, oh thank god, okay.

712
00:47:21,884 --> 00:47:23,284
大変だった
That was rough.

713
00:47:23,884 --> 00:47:28,084
ほら　楽しんでるでしょ！
See? You're having fun!

714
00:47:28,284 --> 00:47:31,584
たぶんこれで家に帰れるはず！
This should probably get you home now!

715
00:47:32,584 --> 00:47:33,884
頑張って！
Good luck!

716
00:47:34,084 --> 00:47:35,584
イェー！ありがとう！
Yeah! Thank you!

717
00:47:35,884 --> 00:47:37,084
バイ！
Bye.

718
00:47:37,584 --> 00:47:40,584
帰ろう！
Go home!

719
00:47:43,284 --> 00:47:44,884
なんだったんだろう...
What was that...

720
00:47:47,584 --> 00:47:50,584
何が起きているのかよくわからないけど
I don't really get what's going on, but

721
00:47:50,584 --> 00:47:54,284
どうやら最後にもう１曲歌えば家に帰れるみたい
apparently I can go home if I sing one last song.

722
00:47:54,584 --> 00:47:56,584
じゃあ　やってみよう
So let's do that.

723
00:47:59,084 --> 00:48:01,584
待って　これなに？
Wait. What's this?

724
00:48:02,884 --> 00:48:05,584
なに？　うん　うん
What? Okay, okay.

725
00:48:05,884 --> 00:48:09,884
上から順番に１つずつ見てみようか
Let's go through them one by one from the top.

726
00:48:10,084 --> 00:48:12,584
何かの役に立つかもしれないし
Maybe they'll be useful for something.

727
00:48:21,884 --> 00:48:25,584
これは私の周年を記念したグッズということだね
So these are the merch celebrating my anniversary ey.

728
00:48:25,884 --> 00:48:28,584
さてなにがあるんだろう
Let's see. I wonder what they've got.

729
00:48:28,884 --> 00:48:32,584
どれも結構使えそうだから　一緒に見ていこう
They all seem pretty useful, so let's check it out together.

730
00:48:32,884 --> 00:48:35,084
まずは　バケットハット
First up, we got a bucket hat.

731
00:48:35,584 --> 00:48:39,284
イラストは　はまなし先生に描いてもらいました
The illustration was done by Hama Nashi sensei.

732
00:48:39,584 --> 00:48:44,584
コンセプトは私が...みんなの予想通り！ラスボスです！
The concept is me being... you guessed it! The final boss!

733
00:48:44,884 --> 00:48:48,584
リバーシブル仕様でイラストも　すごくかっこいい！
It's reversible and the artwork looks really cool!

734
00:48:48,884 --> 00:48:53,584
たぶん着けると防御力も上がりそうな気がする！
And maybe it would make you feel like it would boost your defense stat!

735
00:48:53,884 --> 00:48:55,284
続いては
And next up,

736
00:48:55,584 --> 00:48:58,584
ランダム属性アクリルキーホルダー！
we got a random attribute acrylic keychain.

737
00:48:58,884 --> 00:49:02,284
ちびキャラは Gurin先生に描いてもらいました
The chibi characters were drawn by Gurin sensei!

738
00:49:02,584 --> 00:49:05,284
どれが出るか楽しみだね！ね！
I wonder which one you'll get ey ey?

739
00:49:05,584 --> 00:49:10,584
そしてアクリルキーホルダーの次は...クッションです！
...And after the Acrylic Keychain, we got a Cushion!

740
00:49:11,084 --> 00:49:15,084
これも Gurin先生に描いてもらいました！
The design for this was also done by Gurin sensei.

741
00:49:15,584 --> 00:49:18,284
両面にイラストが入っていて
The cushion has an illustration on both sides,

742
00:49:18,584 --> 00:49:21,584
サイズ感も使いやすいクッションです
and size wise, it's pretty easy to use as well.

743
00:49:22,084 --> 00:49:23,284
次は～
Next up,

744
00:49:23,584 --> 00:49:27,084
可愛いボロスランプです！
we got this cute Boros Lamp!

745
00:49:27,284 --> 00:49:31,284
明るさを２段階で調整できて
Looks like you can adjust the brightness between two levels,

746
00:49:31,584 --> 00:49:34,584
デザインもすっごく可愛い！
and the design is super duper cute,

747
00:49:34,884 --> 00:49:37,284
暗い場所でも安心だね
you'll be safe even in dark places.

748
00:49:37,584 --> 00:49:39,584
怖い時もボロスがいてくれるよ
When you're scared he's got you.

749
00:49:39,884 --> 00:49:41,284
みんな心配しないで
Don't worry everyone.

750
00:49:41,584 --> 00:49:42,884
そして次は
And coming up next,

751
00:49:43,084 --> 00:49:45,584
シチュエーションボイスパック！
we got a situation voice pack!

752
00:49:45,884 --> 00:49:49,284
タイトルは『悪役クロニーのラストループ』です
The title being Villainous Kronii's Final Loop.

753
00:49:49,584 --> 00:49:51,584
何だか不穏なタイトルだけど
Sounds pretty ominous, but,

754
00:49:51,884 --> 00:49:53,284
聴くのが楽しみ！
I can't wait to check it out.

755
00:49:53,584 --> 00:49:54,884
早くチェックしたいな
I want to check it out

756
00:49:55,084 --> 00:49:56,884
もう聴いちゃう気！
I wanna listen to it already.

757
00:49:57,584 --> 00:49:59,084
そして最後に
And finally,

758
00:50:00,120 --> 00:50:01,320
...if you purchase everything,

759
00:50:01,420 --> 00:50:06,920
you'll also receive a cheki-style card with a foil stamped signature,

760
00:50:07,120 --> 00:50:10,420
along with a bonus voice pack.

761
00:50:10,920 --> 00:50:16,620
The card illustration was drawn by, you guessed it, Hama Nashi sensei.

762
00:50:17,120 --> 00:50:19,920
And as for the bonus voice pack...

763
00:50:20,120 --> 00:50:28,320
it's going to be telling the story of joining hands and heading into the final battle in order to bring the loop to an end.

764
00:50:28,620 --> 00:50:32,320
It's going to be very emotional, so go check it out.

